# (build 105) Escape on the Escape menu's pages goes back a level, as B
# does (The owner): from the HDR page to the CRT page, from the CRT page to the
# menu (its cursor still on CRT), and from the menu itself it closes. Before
# this, Escape closed the whole menu from any page. The route reads its own
# settings.json.
start new
wait screen title
display 3840x2400 fullscreen hdr=1.624/1.000 sdr=203
press esc
expect escape-menu open
press down
press down
press down
press down
press c
press up
press c
expect crt peak AUTO 330 NITS
wait ticks 6
shot escape_on_hdr_page
press esc
expect escape-menu open
expect crt hdr OFF
wait ticks 16
shot back_on_crt_page
press esc
expect escape-menu open
expect crt summary OFF
wait ticks 16
shot back_on_menu
press c
press esc
press esc
expect escape-menu closed
expect screen title
